# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# mSpace configuration
#
#   cp .env.example .env
#
# `.env` MUST be git-ignored. This file is committed and must only ever contain
# placeholders — never a real applicationId or password.
#
# In production do not ship a `.env` at all: use your host's secret manager.
#
# NEVER prefix any of these with NEXT_PUBLIC_ / VITE_ / REACT_APP_ — those are
# compiled into the browser bundle and become world-readable.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# ── Credentials ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# The only two values every mSpace application needs. Both come from
# provisioning; for the CaaS services the password is the API key sent to your
# registered email address on application approval. Treat it like a payment key:
# it can send SMS to your whole subscriber base and debit money from your
# subscribers' mobile accounts.

MSPACE_APP_ID=APP_XXXXXX
MSPACE_PASSWORD=replace-me


# ── Service endpoints ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Uncomment ONLY the endpoints for the APIs enabled on your application. An
# application can only call services it was provisioned for — calling anything
# else fails with E1309 no matter how correct the payload is.
#
# Leaving an endpoint unset is how your code knows the service is unavailable:
# the client should refuse to call it rather than fail at the platform.
#
# Point any of these at the mSpace simulator from the developer bundle
# (http://localhost:10001/…) for local development — that is the whole switch.

# ── SMS ──
#MSPACE_SMS_SEND_URL=https://api.mspace.lk/sms/send

# ── USSD ──
#MSPACE_USSD_SEND_URL=https://api.mspace.lk/ussd/send

# ── Subscription ──
# One endpoint serves both register (action 1) and unregister (action 0).
#MSPACE_SUBSCRIPTION_SEND_URL=https://api.mspace.lk/subscription/send
#MSPACE_SUBSCRIPTION_STATUS_URL=https://api.mspace.lk/subscription/getStatus
#MSPACE_SUBSCRIPTION_QUERY_BASE_URL=https://api.mspace.lk/subscription/query-base
#MSPACE_SUBSCRIPTION_CHARGING_INFO_URL=https://api.mspace.lk/subscription/getSubscriberChargingInfo
#MSPACE_SUBSCRIPTION_LIST_URL=https://api.mspace.lk/subscription/getSubscriberList
#MSPACE_SUBSCRIPTION_NOTIFY_URL=https://api.mspace.lk/subscription/notify

# ── OTP ── (activating a subscription from a web or app sign-up)
#MSPACE_OTP_REQUEST_URL=https://api.mspace.lk/otp/request
#MSPACE_OTP_VERIFY_URL=https://api.mspace.lk/otp/verify

# ── CaaS ── charging. Two calls, one transaction: generation sends the OTP,
# verification takes the money. Both must be configured to charge anyone.
#MSPACE_CAAS_DEBIT_URL=https://api.mspace.lk/caas/direct/debit
#MSPACE_CAAS_OTP_VERIFY_URL=https://api.mspace.lk/caas/otp/verify

# ── LBS ──
#MSPACE_LBS_REQUEST_URL=https://api.mspace.lk/lbs/request
